✅ 3. Daemon Thread vs User Thread

| Feature                     | User Thread           | Daemon Thread           |
| --------------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Purpose                     | Main application work | Background support work |
| JVM Waits Before Shutdown   | ✅ Yes                 | ❌ No                    |
| Default Thread Type         | ✅ Yes                 | ❌ No                    |
| Suitable for Critical Tasks | ✅ Yes                 | ❌ No                    |
| Can End Abruptly            | ❌ No (normally waits) | ✅ Yes                   |
| Example                     | Payment Processing    | Garbage Collector       |


